---
import { LINKS } from "../../constants/links";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import { Check } from "@lucide/astro";
import mockupHero from "../../assets/lp/mockup-3d-parcelas.webp";
import { heroVideoStory } from "../../data/landingData";
---

<section
  class="relative overflow-hidden pt-5 sm:pt-8 lg:pt-14 pb-4 lg:pb-20 bg-gradient-to-b from-[#f0f4f8] to-white"
>
  <div class="max-w-[1120px] mx-auto px-5">
    <div
      class="flex flex-col lg:grid lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_0.9fr] items-center gap-6 lg:gap-12"
    >
      <!-- Texto -->
      <div class="w-full max-w-[640px] mx-auto lg:mx-0 text-center lg:text-left">
        <div
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 bg-[#f59e0b]/15 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full text-[#92400e] font-bold text-[13px] mb-4"
        >
          🚐 Para motoristas do transporte escolar
        </div>

        <h1
          style="text-wrap: balance;"
          class="text-[1.85rem] leading-[1.12] sm:text-[2.4rem] lg:text-[3.1rem] lg:leading-[1.08] font-black tracking-tight text-[#1a3a5c] mb-4"
        >
          Receba as mensalidades em dia
          <span class="text-[#d97706]">sem precisar cobrar os pais.</span>
        </h1>

        <p
          class="text-[1.06rem] sm:text-[1.15rem] lg:text-[1.2rem] text-slate-700 leading-relaxed mb-6 lg:max-w-[560px]"
        >
          O Van360 manda o lembrete no WhatsApp dos pais com o seu Pix, mostra
          quem já pagou e organiza alunos, contratos e recibos no celular.
        </p>

        <div
          class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch sm:items-center justify-center lg:justify-start gap-3"
        >
          <a
            href={LINKS.APP_REGISTER_URL}
            class="lp-cta-glow inline-flex items-center justify-center bg-[#f59e0b] hover:bg-[#d97706] text-[#1a1a1a] font-black text-[1.1rem] px-8 py-4 rounded-xl hover:-translate-y-0.5 transition-all min-h-[56px] shadow-xl"
          >
            Testar 15 dias grátis →
          </a>
          <button
            type="button"
            data-video-story={JSON.stringify(heroVideoStory)}
            class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2.5 text-[#1a3a5c] font-bold text-base px-5 py-2 sm:py-3.5 rounded-xl sm:bg-white sm:border border-slate-200 hover:border-[#f59e0b] sm:shadow-sm transition-all min-h-[44px] sm:min-h-[52px] cursor-pointer"
          >
            <span
              class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-[#1a3a5c] text-white flex items-center justify-center shrink-0"
            >
              <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5 ml-0.5 fill-current" viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                ><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z"></path></svg
              >
            </span>
            Ver o app funcionando
          </button>
        </div>

        <ul
          class="flex flex-wrap justify-center lg:justify-start gap-x-4 gap-y-1.5 mt-4 text-[0.92rem] font-semibold text-slate-700"
        >
          <li class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <Check class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600" stroke-width={3} /> Sem cartão
          </li>
          <li class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <Check class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600" stroke-width={3} /> Sem fidelidade
          </li>
          <li class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5">
            <Check class="w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600" stroke-width={3} /> Suporte no WhatsApp
          </li>
        </ul>

        <p class="hidden lg:block mt-6 text-[0.95rem] text-slate-600">
          <strong class="text-[#1a3a5c]">Mais de 500 motoristas</strong> já organizam
          a van com o Van360.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Visual: celular + mensagem que chega no pai -->
      <div class="relative w-full max-w-[420px] lg:max-w-[460px] mx-auto">
        <div class="relative pl-6 sm:pl-10 lg:pl-0">
          <Image
            src={mockupHero}
            alt="Tela do Van360 mostrando quem pagou e quem está devendo"
            loading="eager"
            fetchpriority="high"
            widths={[360, 480, 720, 920]}
            sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 460px, (min-width: 640px) 420px, 92vw"
            class="w-full h-auto select-none"
          />
        </div>

        <!-- Mensagem do WhatsApp (o que o pai recebe) -->
        <div
          class="absolute left-0 lg:-left-4 top-[6%] w-[64%] sm:w-[60%] max-w-[250px] rounded-2xl bg-[#e7ffdb] shadow-[0_12px_32px_rgba(0,0,0,0.18)] border border-emerald-100 p-3 text-left"
          style="animation: lp-countUp .6s cubic-bezier(0.34, 1.56, 0.64, 1) .5s both;"
          aria-hidden="true"
        >
          <div class="flex items-center gap-1.5 mb-1.5">
            <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-[#25D366] flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="w-3 h-3 fill-white"><path d="M12 2a10 10 0 0 0-8.6 15.1L2 22l5-1.3A10 10 0 1 0 12 2z"></path></svg>
            </span>
            <span class="text-[0.78rem] font-bold text-slate-700">WhatsApp do pai</span>
          </div>
          <p class="text-[0.88rem] leading-snug text-slate-800">
            Oi! A mensalidade do <strong>Miguel</strong> vence hoje: <strong>R$ 350,00</strong>.
          </p>
          <div
            class="mt-2 rounded-lg bg-white text-center text-[0.82rem] font-bold text-[#0a7cff] py-1.5 border border-emerald-100"
          >
            Copiar código Pix
          </div>
          <div class="mt-1 text-right text-[0.68rem] text-slate-500">enviado automaticamente</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <p class="lg:hidden text-center text-[0.95rem] text-slate-600 -mt-2 mb-2">
        <strong class="text-[#1a3a5c]">Mais de 500 motoristas</strong> já organizam a
        van com o Van360.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
